#: patcherly.php:1421
msgid "Patcherly has already secured storage folders with .htaccess and web.config, but a canary file under uploads/patcherly returned HTTP 200 ? common on Nginx or Apache with AllowOverride None. For defense in depth (recommended for any plugin that stores backups), add a vhost deny for uploads/patcherly. PATCHERLY_BACKUP_ROOT only moves backups; queue, fix-cache, locks, and emergency.log stay under uploads."
msgstr "Patcherly ha gi? protetto le cartelle di storage con .htaccess e web.config, ma un file canary in uploads/patcherly ha restituito HTTP 200 ? frequente su Nginx o Apache con AllowOverride None. Per difesa in profondit? (consigliato per qualsiasi plugin che conserva backup), aggiungi un deny vhost per uploads/patcherly. PATCHERLY_BACKUP_ROOT sposta solo i backup; coda, fix-cache, lock ed emergency.log restano in uploads."

